QuestGuidance.Register("en",310,{
[9889]="70020C37\n1\tDefeat creatures hunting the ox-herds of the Uch-lûth (total: 3)\tThe Uch-lûth's herds graze to the north-east of Uch Cadlus. Davudh has asked you to continue protecting their herds against the wolves and other fell things which hunt them in return for a continuing supply of meat for the Grey Company.\n2\tTalk to Davudh at Uch Cadlus\tDavudh is at Uch Cadlus, south-west of the ox-herds. You should return to Davudh with news of your success.\n3\tBring the ox-meat to Amlan at Echad Saeradan\tAmlan is at Echad Saeradan, far to the north-west of Uch Cadlus. Davudh gave you a package of meat to take to the Rangers of the Grey Company.\n4\tTalk to Davudh at Uch Cadlus\tDavudh is at Uch Cadlus, far to the south-east of Echad Saeradan. Amlan told you to convey his thanks to Davudh.\n",
[9890]="70003812\n1\tDefeat Dourhand warriors (total: 6)\030Defeat sturdy Dourhands (total: 3)\tThe Dourhand brigands can be found to the north of Gondamon. Orlygr has asked you to deal with the Dourhand brigands which have been harrying the hunters of Gondamon.\n2\tTalk to Orlygr at Gondamon\tOrlygr is at Gondamon to the south of the Dourhand-encampment. You should return to Orlygr and report your success against the Dourhand brigands.\n",
[9891]="7002C8E3\n1\tDefeat Mor-hai defilers (total: 5)\030Defeat Mor-hai scavengers (total: 5)\tThe Orcs have been wandering north of the road that leads west from Stangard, in the north-west regions of the Wailing Hills. Penda has made it clear that the Orcs pose a threat to the safety of travel along the road and that they must be dealt with carefully.\n2\tReturn to Penda at Frithstan's Camp\tPenda can be found at the Rohirrim-camp along the road north of the Cuthstan and west of Stangard. Penda awaits your return from protecting the road from the Orcs.\n",
[9892]="70069069\n1\tDefeat Corsairs (total: 15)\030Tend to wounded crew-members (total: 8)\tYou have been tasked with protecting the Khâlbina from threats on her route to Jax Phanâl. You were below deck for a moment when you heard shouting from above. You've been boarded by Corsairs!\n2\tDefeat Captain Belizâm the Bitter at the ship's helm\tFind and defeat Captain Belizâm the Bitter.\n",
[9893]="70066745\n1\tCollect the newly-crafted arrows in Tingobel\tNewly-crafted arrows can be found in a barrel near Boradan's forge in Tingobel. Boradan has asked you to collect his newly-crafted arrows and deliver them to the bowmen in Tingobel. You should collect the newly-crafted arrows.\n2\tBowmen can be found throughout Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale. You have collected the newly-crafted arrows from Boradan. You should deliver them to the bowmen in Tingobel.\t\n3\tTalk to Boradan\tBoradan can be found in Tingobel. You have delivered the arrows to the bowmen in Tingobel. You should return to Boradan.\n",
[9894]="7005342C\n1\tComplete Protecting Avabárg\tAudvak can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak.\n2\tComplete Protecting Avabárg (total: 2)\tAudvak can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak.\n3\tTalk to Audvak\tAudvak can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak.\n",
[9895]="7004430E\n1\tDefeat Mordor loggers (total: 8)\tMordor loggers can be found on the edge of Talath Anor's woods. You should defeat Mordor loggers.\n2\tSpeak with Tolwin\tSpeak with Tolwin.\n",
[9896]="70026F00\n1\tTalk to Alun at the scouts' camp\030Collect beetle-shells (total: 6)\tBog-beetles can be found in the Dunbog. Alun is encamped in the north-eastern part of the Dunbog. Alun has asked you to gather beetle-shells for the Avanc-lûth and bring them to him.\n",
[9897]="70043DA9\n1\tCollect shells from River Turtles (total: 10)\tRiver Turtles can be found along the Anduin in Osgiliath. You should collect River Turtle shells.\n2\tBring the Turtle Shells to Cangoras at the Palace of Eldacar\tCangoras is at the Palace of Eldacar. You should bring the Turtle Shells to Cangoras.\n",
[9898]="7001B75C\n1\tTalk to Rodelleth\tRodelleth is the commanding officer at Thangúlhad. She is waiting for you to report in.\n2\tDefeat the first assault\tThe forces of Dol Guldur are marching against the defences of Thangúlhad. You must protect the fort and keep it secure.\n3\tDefeat the second assault\tThe first assault has been defeated, but the battle is far from over.\n4\tDefeat the third assault\tThe second assault has been defeated, but the battle is far from over.\n5\tDefeat the fourth assault\tThe third assault has been defeated, their numbers are beginning to thin.\n6\tDefeat the fifth assault\tThe fourth assault has been defeated. The Enemy is launching one final desperate assault against the walls of Thangúlhad.\n7\tTalk to Rodelleth\tThe enemy leader is approaching: a fearsome Olog-hai. Rodelleth wishes to discuss the final battle-plan with you.\n8\tDefeat Mazaukal and claim the Enemy's banner\tThe enemy leader has challenged you to come and fight him outside the protection of your fortifications. Fortunately, Rodelleth is manning the catapults.\n",
[9899]="70029FC1\n1\tComplete 'Protectors of Thangúlhad' in a raid group\tThangúlhad is being assaulted by the forces of Dol Guldur. They wish to reclaim it and eliminate the foothold the Golden Host has secured.\n",
[9900]="700576BB\n1\tComplete bounties in Limlók.\t\n2\tComplete Bounty: Goblin at Tithroz\030Complete Bounty: Goblin in the Cabed Rhimdath\030Complete Bounty: Goblin at Veithhól\030Complete Bounty: Goblin at Scraper's Clough\030Complete Bounty: Goblin at the Forest's Edge\tComplete bounties in Limlók.\n",
[9901]="7004F6F3\n1\tDefeat bees while collecting honey (total: 6)\tTake care of any bees that get in your way while collecting honey.\n2\tCompleted\tTake care of any bees that get in your way while collecting honey.\n",
[9902]="700529A3\n1\tComplete Quests of the Wilderfolk\tAudvak, Hithril, and Ragnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak, Hithril, and Ragnild about further protecting the Vales of Anduin.\n2\tTalk to Ragnild\030Talk to Audvak\030Talk to Hithril\tAudvak, Hithril, and Ragnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak, Hithril, and Ragnild about further protecting the Vales of Anduin.\n",
[9903]="7000EC63\n1\tCollect hobbit-feet (total: 10)\tHoarhallow lies to the south of Gramsfoot. Soldier Búzog instructed to bring feet from the hobbits in Hoarhallow, securing your favour in the eyes of the War-tyrant.\n2\tBring the hobbit-feet to Soldier Búzog\tSoldier Búzog is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You should bring the hobbit-feet you collected to Soldier Búzog.\n",
[9904]="70067DA0\n1\tHarvest sheaves of wheat ([see journal]/6)\030Collect elderberry bunches ([see journal]/10)\tKhûtra Elder Roshat asks that you search for food for his village. Berries and wheat can be found to the east of Khûtra.\n2\tReturn the food to Elder Roshat in Khûtra\tReturn the food to Khûtra Elder Roshat.\n",
[9905]="7003783F\n1\tDefeat Orcs (total: 4)\tOrcs threaten to ruin crops and injure the farmers at Folde Farm. You should defeat the Orcs and prevent them from destroying the farm.\n2\tCompleted\tThe Orcs at the Folde Farm have been defeated; however, the possibility of another assault still looms.\n",
[9906]="7003A67D\n1\tDefeat Orcs (total: 4)\tOrcs threaten to ruin crops and injure the farmers at Folde Farm. You should defeat the Orcs and prevent them from destroying the farm.\n2\tCompleted\tThe Orcs at the Folde Farm have been defeated; however, the possibility of another assault still looms.\n",
[9907]="700686A0\n1\tGather tufts of fur from slain goats at Súlstrok ([see journal]/10)\tTagar believes that the goblins are attempting to starve the people of Jax Phanâl. He asked that you look for proof in their camp of Súlstrok to the south and east of the outpost.\n2\tTagar believes that the goblins are attempting to starve the people of Jax Phanâl. He asked that you look for proof of this sort in their camp to the south and east of the outpost.\t\n",
[9908]="700077AE\n1\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n2\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n3\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n4\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n5\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n6\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n7\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n8\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n9\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n10\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n11\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n12\t This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n13\tTalk to Éogar, son of Hadorgar\tÉogar is at Hengstacer, north of Bree-town. You have completed the course and should now speak with Éogar. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[9909]="7003E91D\n1\tCollect venison from the elk of the Southern Trollshaws\tThere are elk dwelling in the Southern Trollshaws. While you are here, you should collect venison for Barachen and the Elves who patrol the Southern Trollshaws.\n2\tCollect venison from the elk of the Southern Trollshaws (total: 6)\tThere are elk dwelling in the Southern Trollshaws. While you are here, you should collect venison for Barachen and the Elves who patrol the Southern Trollshaws.\n3\tBring the venison you collected to Barachen\tBarachen is encamped in the Southern Trollshaws. You should bring the venison you collected to Barachen in the Southern Trollshaws.\n",
[9910]="7003E91E\n1\tCollect venison from the elk of Tâl Bruinen\tThere are elk dwelling in Tâl Bruinen. While you are here, you should collect venison for the hunters loitering at Echad Candelleth.\n2\tCollect venison from the elk of Tâl Bruinen (total: 6)\tThere are elk dwelling in Tâl Bruinen. While you are here, you should collect venison for the hunters loitering at Echad Candelleth.\n3\tBring the venison you collected to one of the hunters loitering at Echad Candelleth\tThere are hunters at Echad Candelleth in Tâl Bruinen. You should bring the venison you collected to one of the hunters in Tâl Bruinen.\n",
[9911]="70027B76\n1\tCollect provisions within Tûr Morva (total: 8)\tProvisions for war can be found throughout the village of Tûr Morva. Seren has asked you to steal provisions back from the Falcon-clan.\n2\tBring the provisions to Seren\tSeren is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.\n",
[9912]="70001861\n1\tCollect Aurochs-steak (total: 5)\tAurochs roam the plains of the Kingsfell, north of Lin Giliath. Aglardir has asked you to hunt aurochs in Kingsfell for meat to replenish the stores of Lin Giliath.\n2\tTalk to Aglardir\030Collect Aurochs-steak (total: 5)\tAglardir is in Lin Giliath, south of the Kingsfell. Aglardir is awaiting your return with the aurochs meat to replenish the lost provisions kept at Lin Giliath.\n",
[9913]="7005B110\n1\tCollect deer meat (total: 8)\030Collect boar meat (total: 6)\030Collect moose meat (total: 4)\tMoose, deer, and wild boar can be found throughout the woods of Azanulbizar. Thorin has asked you to hunt the beasts of Azanulbizar for meat to feed the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.\n2\tDeliver the meat to Thorin at Amdân\tThorin can be found at Amdân. You should deliver the meat to Thorin.\n",
[9914]="70070D02\n1\tDefeat jackals in the Pits of Chortáth (total: 10)\tYour mission is to travel to Pits of Chortáth in the south-west and help the scouts of Sâr Marsag make the paths safer to travel by thinning the pack of jackals in the area.\n2\tDefeat the pack-leader\tYour mission is to travel to Pits of Chortáth in the south-west and help the scouts of Sâr Marsag make the paths safer to travel by thinning the pack of jackals in the area.\n",
[9915]="70037980\n1\tDefeat half-orc scouting parties (total: 5)\tHalf-orc scouting parties can be found prowling the woods surrounding Grimslade in the south-eastern Westfold. You should defeat half-orc scouting parties.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the scouting parties terrorizing the woods near Grimslade.\n",
[9916]="7002F83D\n1\tDefeat a Warg pack-leader\030Defeat Warg pack-runners (total: 2)\tSouth of Feldburg is a large den of Wargs who have grown increasingly dangerous to travellers and soldiers. You should defeat members of the pack that have begun to encroach upon the fields.\n2\tReturn to Captain Agelmund in Feldburg\tCaptain Agelmund can be found at Feldburg. You should speak with Captain Agelmund.\n",
[9917]="7006EEE2\n1\tEnter Garash Kâru in southern Ambarûl\tTravel to Garash Kâru in southern Ambarûl. Garash Kâru can be found south-west of Iridír, over the river Ikorbân.\n2\tDestroy barricades at Garash Kâru (total: 6)\030Defeat Ekhamâti look-outs at Garash Kâru (total: 5)\030Defeat Ekhamâti sorcerers at Garash Kâru (total: 4)\030Defeat Ekhamâti cat-keepers at Garash Kâru (total: 3)\tDestroy barricades and defeat Ekhamâti at Garash Kâru in Ambarûl. Garash Kâru can be found due south of Iridír.\n3\tDefeat Rumûza at Garash Kâru\tDefeat Rumûza at Garash Kâru in Ambarûl.\n4\tPlant Mizâdi's banner in the centre of Garash Kâru\tPlant Mizâdi's banner in the centre of Garash Kâru.\n5\tReturn to Mizâdi in Iridír with news of your success\tReturn to Mizâdi in Iridír with news of the fall of Garash Kâru.\n",
[9918]="70057808\n1\tDefeat shades near the abandoned house\tShades haunt the empty carcass of a long-abandoned house, posing a threat to those who draw too near the forgotten structure. If combat will lay these spirits to rest, it falls to you to make the attempt.\n2\tDefeat shades near the abandoned house (total: 6)\tShades haunt the empty carcass of a long-abandoned house, posing a threat to those who draw too near the forgotten structure. If combat will lay these spirits to rest, it falls to you to make the attempt.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
[9919]="70001816\n1\tFind and defeat the leader of the Dourhands\tThurûm is north of Othrikar. You should search Thurûm for the source of the Dourhand presence, and defeat the leader of this rabble.\n2\tDefeat Torfi Hammerhorn\tThurûm is north of Othrikar. You should search Thurûm for the source of the Dourhand presence, and defeat the leader of this rabble.\n3\tTalk to Hannar\tHannar is at Othrikar. Torfi Hammerhorn perished during the battle at his camp, routing his forces. You should return to Hannar with news of your victory.\n",
[9920]="7006835A\n1\tCollect sets of crocodile incisors ([see journal]/10)\tTevurin directed you to the shore south and east of the expedition camp in search of pristine crocodile teeth. He requires ten incisors to satisfy his quota.\n2\tTevurin directed you to the shore south and west of the expedition camp in search of pristine crocodile teeth. He requires ten incisors to satisfy his quota.\t\n",
